      "description": "ThreadTitleAttempt {thread_id, attempt_id, requested_route, effective_route?, outcome, title?, at} (ACD-479): one record per automatic or explicit naming of a thread. An unavailable title model records route_unavailable and is never silently replaced by another model, so route_unavailable carries no effective_route; named carries the title.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "thread_id",
        "attempt_id",
        "requested_route",
        "outcome",
        "at"
      ],
      "properties": {
